">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 3. tool behaviour (PHP serialize / unserialize) ═══ -->\n<div id=\"ser\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<div class=\"ser-wrap\">\n<div class=\"ser-cols\">\n<!-- LEFT -->\n<section class=\"ser-card\">\n<div class=\"ser-sec\"><span class=\"ser-ic\"></span><h2>SERIALIZED</h2><span class=\"ser-line\"></span><span class=\"ser-hint\" id=\"tok\"></span></div>\n<textarea id=\"inp\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"PHP-serialized input\"></textarea>\n<div class=\"ser-actions\">\n<button class=\"ser-btn ser-primary\" id=\"parseBtn\">Parse</button>\n<button class=\"ser-btn ser-ghost\" id=\"demoBtn\">Corrupt the length</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ser-sec\"><span class=\"ser-ic\"></span><h2>FIND → REPLACE</h2><span class=\"ser-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"ser-findrow\">\n<div class=\"ser-fin\"><label class=\"ser-lbl\">Find</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"find\" placeholder=\"Home\"></div>\n<div class=\"ser-fin\"><label class=\"ser-lbl\">Replace</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"repl\" placeholder=\"Home SweetHome\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ser-inline-opts\">\n<label class=\"ser-chk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ci\"> case-insensitive</label>\n<label class=\"ser-chk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"bytes\"> match bytes (not chars)</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ser-actions\">\n<button class=\"ser-btn ser-primary\" id=\"reserBtn\">Re-serialize</button>\n<button class=\"ser-btn ser-ghost\" id=\"fixBtn\">Simple length-fix</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- RIGHT -->\n<section class=\"ser-card\">\n<div class=\"ser-sec\"><span class=\"ser-ic\"></span><h2>TREE VIEW</h2><span class=\"ser-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"ser-rootstat\" id=\"rootstat\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"ser-msg\" id=\"treemsg\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"ser-tree\" id=\"tree\"></div>\n<div class=\"ser-sec\"><span class=\"ser-ic\"></span><h2>RE-SERIALIZED</h2><span class=\"ser-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"ser-msg\" id=\"outmsg\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"ser-out\" id=\"out\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"ser-changed\" id=\"changed\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"ser-mb\" id=\"mb\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"ser-actions\">\n<button class=\"ser-btn ser-ghost\" id=\"copyBtn\">Copy serialized</button>\n<button class=\"ser-btn ser-primary\" id=\"dlBtn\">Download .txt</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ser-how\"><b>How to use:</b> Paste a raw PHP-serialized string (from wp_options etc), hit Parse. If a value looks broken, fill find → replace and hit Re-serialize - it rewrites every s:&lt;len&gt;: prefix from the real byte length, so unserialize() will not error. Or use Simple length-fix to just repair a damaged blob.</div>\n</section>\n</div><!-- /.ser-cols -->\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ related tools (6-point law #3) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"ser-related\" aria-labelledby=\"ser-related-h\">\n<h2 id=\"ser-related-h\" class=\"ser-related-h\">&gt;_ Related tools</h2>\n<div class=\"ser-related-grid\">\n<a class=\"ser-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/debug-log-analyzer/\">\n<span class=\"ser-rel-name\">Debug Log Analyzer</span>\n<span class=\"ser-rel-desc\">Paste a debug.log and see what actually failed.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"ser-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/wp-config-generator/\">\n<span class=\"ser-rel-name\">wp-config Generator</span>\n<span class=\"ser-rel-desc\">The file many of these options live in.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"ser-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/json-formatter/\">\n<span class=\"ser-rel-name\">JSON Formatter</span>\n<span class=\"ser-rel-desc\">Same tree view for JSON payloads.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"ser-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/sqlite-mysql-converter/\">\n<span class=\"ser-rel-name\">SQLite ⇄ MySQL Converter</span>\n<span class=\"ser-rel-desc\">Migrating data, not just options.</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ═══ visible FAQ (6-point law #2 - mirrors the FAQPage schema byte-exact) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"ser-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"ser-faq-h\">\n<h2 id=\"ser-faq-h\" class=\"ser-faq-h\">&gt;_ FAQ</h2>\n<details class=\"ser-faq-item\">\n<summary>Why does a serialized WordPress option break after a search/replace?</summary>\n<p>PHP-serialized strings store the byte length of each string as a prefix (s:&lt;len&gt;:&quot;...&quot;). A search/replace or migration that changes a value without updating that length makes PHP unserialize() throw &quot;Error at offset.&quot; This tool parses the string, shows the mismatch, and re-serializes with every length recalculated from the real UTF-8 byte length.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"ser-faq-item\">\n<summary>Is the serialized length measured in characters or bytes?</summary>\n<p>PHP strlen counts UTF-8 bytes, not characters. This tool is byte-accurate, so emoji, accented letters, and CJK text are handled correctly - the most common cause of the &quot;shown length&quot; mismatch.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"ser-faq-item\">\n<summary>Is my data uploaded anywhere?</summary>\n<p>No - the parser and re-serializer run entirely in your browser with JavaScript. Nothing is uploaded, logged, or stored; close the tab and it is gone.</p>\n</details>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"ser-foot\">byte lengths use the PHP strlen convention (UTF-8 bytes) · test the result with unserialize() in PHP · no server, nothing is uploaded</footer>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--in-content\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-300x250-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--before-footer\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"c